{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>A month of days.</b> I explained it that the measure of the moon will return in its light as it was, and likewise שנתים ימים." "And the meaning of <b>מאפכם</b> — that the odor comes in the nostril and the odor goes out from it and is not found." "<b>לזרא.</b> With alef in place of heh, like קראן לי מרא, for the letters alef, heh, vav, yod interchange. And the meaning of <b>לזרא</b> is a strange thing, repulsive to nature, which a person is not accustomed to."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:14.617425361Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}